{"id":"vermutung","lemma":"Vermutung","pos":"noun","rank":3856,"glosses":["guess","supposition","suspicion"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/75/De-at-Vermutung.ogg/De-at-Vermutung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Vermutung","plural":"Vermutungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Deine Vermutung ist so gut wie meine.","en":"Your guess is as good as mine.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,null,null,{"g":"my","l":"mein"}],"phrases":[[3,6,"almost, as good as"]]},{"text":"Das sind nur Vermutungen.","en":"Those are just assumptions.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},null]},{"text":"Deine Vermutung liegt komplett daneben.","en":"Your guess is entirely off the mark.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"complete, entire"},{"g":"next to it"}]},{"text":"Diese Vermutung ist grundsätzlich korrekt.","en":"This assumption is basically correct.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in principle"},{"g":"correct"}]},{"text":"Du liegst mit deiner Vermutung völlig daneben.","en":"Your assumption is completely wrong.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"yours, thine"},null,{"g":"completely"},{"g":"next to it"}]}]}